{"id":"zavtra","lemma":"завтра","pos":"adv","rank":179,"glosses":["tomorrow"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/29/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Завтра я весь день дома.","en":"I'll be at home all day tomorrow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/681350","words":[null,{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"at home"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"all day"]]},{"text":"Как насчёт завтра?","en":"How about tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"about"},null]},{"text":"Мы можем встретиться завтра?","en":"Can we meet tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to meet"},null]},{"text":"Ты можешь сделать это завтра?","en":"Can you do it tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Я его завтра увижу.","en":"I'm going to see him tomorrow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274865","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"увидеть"}]}]}